&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;"&gt;Golden Spread has a long&amp;#8209;term service and parts supply and parts repair agreement (LTSPA) covering certain Mustang station units to provide service and labor for major maintenance of generation equipment, certain parts and refurbishment services, other spare parts at discount prices, and other factory repair services. The amounts for the third major inspection are amortized through November 2025.&lt;/p&gt;
